    {
      "id": "L-S2E08-C01",
      "title": "Hope sends Lizzie to find Landon.",
      "description": "With a new monster in town, Hope asks Lizzie to track Landon down and keep him safe.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        {
          "character": "Josie",
          "version": "Josie"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "protect",
        "search",
        "worry"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Something to travel in? I'm gonna need you to hit the road."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "You want me to quest for Frodo Baggins, don't you?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "We don't know what they want, or even who they're working for anymore. I just need Landon to be safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Fine. A little locator spell and then off to Mordor I go."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Ho, ho, ho! I come bearing gifts. More like a peace offering, really."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "I thought that the three of us had already made peace."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Well, this whole school year, I have been really naughty. I've not been the supportive sister that I want to be."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "And then there's Landon. It was wrong of me to be jealous when his subconscious just chose you. But thankfully, Christmas is all about forgiveness, right? Cookie?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Run. What kind of cookie?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Something to travel in? I'm gonna need you to hit the road."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "You want me to quest for Frodo Baggins, don't you?  I thought that the monsters weren't after him now."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "We don't know what they want, or even who they're working for anymore. I just need Landon to be safe."
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "L-S2E08-C02",
      "title": "Lizzie asks Landon to come back and face Hope and Josie.",
      "description": "Lizzie catches up with Landon and calls him out for leaving Hope and Josie without explaining why. She asks him to come back to the school.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Lizzie",
          "version": "Lizzie"
        },
        {
          "character": "Sebastian",
          "version": "Sebastian"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "goodbye",
        "protect",
        "advice"
      ],
      "importance": 2,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Leaving Hope and Josie without having the balls to say why was one thing, but now you're ditching Raf?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "As long as monsters are after me, he's in danger, too. I needed to find someplace where I knew he'd be safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "So what is your plan, Huck Finn... Ride the rails?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "My only plan is to make sure that nobody else gets hurt because of me, because that really sucks."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Come back to the school with me, face Hope and Josie, and then they will help you face whatever comes next. We all will. What do you say?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E08-C02-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "I say you people talk entirely too much when action is required."
          }
        ]
      },
